  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Green Hydrogen certification workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity covers the organisational costs of the CERF hydrogen certification workshop in Cairo on 7 October 2025. It includes venue rental, catering, interpretation services, and the organisation of a networking reception at the Dutch Embassy.The reception, held following the workshop, facilitates informal exchange between Egyptian stakeholders, including relevant ministries and national councils, and the Dutch delegation. The activity supports dialogue and collaboration on hydrogen certification.</narrative>
  </description>
